# Base image for the ReceiptPi image: Raspberry Pi OS Lite (64-bit),
# Debian 13 "trixie", release 2026-10-06.
#
# BASE_SHA256 is the checksum published next to the download
# (<BASE_URL>.sha256). BASE_IMG_SHA256 and BASE_IMG_SIZE are the checksum
# and size of the decompressed image as listed in the Raspberry Pi Imager
# catalogue (https://downloads.raspberrypi.com/os_list_imagingutility_v4.json,
# extract_sha256 and extract_size). The build stops if either does not match.
BASE_URL=https://downloads.raspberrypi.com/raspios_lite_arm64/images/raspios_lite_arm64-2026-10-06/2026-10-06-raspios-trixie-arm64-lite.img.xz
